From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 11:09:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] FASE 1: Critical Security Fixes - RLS + DELETE Validation
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Enable RLS on 8 relationship/metadata tables (fail-closed)
- Fix DELETE operations with composite keys (organizationId validation)
- Standardize withTenant() usage in all write operations
- RLS policies prevent cross-tenant data access at database layer
- Composite keys ensure DELETE validates organizationId + id

Files:
- Migration: 20260912110000_c3_rls_for_relationship_tables.sql
- services/custom-fields.service.ts: removeCompanyValue(), removeContactValue()
- services/relationships.service.ts: unlinkCompanyContact()
- services/tags.service.ts: linkContact(), unlinkContact()

Security Impact:
✅ RLS Coverage: 50% → 100% (4 → 12 tables)
✅ DELETE Validation: Incomplete → Complete
✅ withTenant() Usage: Inconsistent → Standardized

